{"name": "Spirit Crossing", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/3ba8ace2aa603e04c045df0ce0138f0f.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/3ba8ace2aa603e04c045df0ce0138f0f.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to Spirit Crossing, a land connecting humans and spirits. A mysterious guide prompts you to join a thriving community dedicated to restoring broken bonds. Play with your friends to help spirits, fellow humans, and sassy little bears in need.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Uncover the secrets of the Crosslands while learning about the lives and trauma of those who make their homes here.<br/><br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"106\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bff98ddd1f34f8b78da2dd458ead7b92.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bff98ddd1f34f8b78da2dd458ead7b92.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bff98ddd1f34f8b78da2dd458ead7b92.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/5bfc9afd1e17f7dd9da8f645952aebe2.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/5bfc9afd1e17f7dd9da8f645952aebe2.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Come home to your waystation, a collaborative neighborhood you\u2019ll care for with other players. Together, you\u2019ll build, decorate, fortify and sustain your sanctuary. You can also visit other waystations to play with new friends and explore different sights - sometimes you\u2019ll find inspiration to bring back home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"106\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/4e277bd5e6ef12d0ab01decdb2f66978.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/4e277bd5e6ef12d0ab01decdb2f66978.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/4e277bd5e6ef12d0ab01decdb2f66978.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/8a7f4225fb268d4f80277d372137f03c.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/8a7f4225fb268d4f80277d372137f03c.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Curate your social experience with customizable expressions, friendship progression tracks, and a variety of sittable environments for open dialogue. Level up your friendships with other players to unlock proximity chat, interactive two-player emotes, teleportation, gift giving, and more!<br/><br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"106\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/ea5917342b964c755253150da05f93ab.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/ea5917342b964c755253150da05f93ab.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/ea5917342b964c755253150da05f93ab.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/485dbd0cf76bc4c09b5dcd37c3d3f78c.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/485dbd0cf76bc4c09b5dcd37c3d3f78c.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cursed storms batter the shrines and beacons that protect these lands, but weathering them will bring its own rewards. While adventuring through Wilderness peaks, you'll find comfort at bonfires while you wait out the storm with other players. Afterward, enjoy a Rainbow Time buff together while you harvest colorful Beacon Energy drops scattered throughout the islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"106\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/746aae7896801457edaf88653085074d.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/746aae7896801457edaf88653085074d.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/746aae7896801457edaf88653085074d.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/4a53fcda07a4e59f8a48ba2498521f73.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/4a53fcda07a4e59f8a48ba2498521f73.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While exploring, you\u2019ll meet both people and spirits who need your help. Sometimes they'll need medicine or a snack, other times they'll ask for a favor and some kindness. With patience, these characters will begin to reveal more about themselves, gifting items and stories. Spirits in particular will communicate in some curious ways!<br/><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"106\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/a46dabccad484c44b4509d347c21af26.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/a46dabccad484c44b4509d347c21af26.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/a46dabccad484c44b4509d347c21af26.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/1514c382180941c30e8274a453784b8b.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/1514c382180941c30e8274a453784b8b.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fix up and decorate a comfy house on your very own mountain peak! Your home and the surrounding landscape can be built, managed, and decorated as you see fit, perfect for hosting gatherings with friends. Oh, and the place may even come with a tiny roommate. \ud83d\udc3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"106\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bded6fe9a753a8ae650e5fabf6c911fd.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bded6fe9a753a8ae650e5fabf6c911fd.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bded6fe9a753a8ae650e5fabf6c911fd.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 Villagers, spirits, little bears, and other players to meet and befriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 An at-your-own-pace friendship progression system with rewards for playing together<br/>\u27e2 A variety of musical instruments for group jam sessions and solo improv</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 Solo and co-op mini-game activities, puzzles, and tournaments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 Mystical new mountaintop ruins every few days to climb, explore, and rebuild</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 Expressive character customization options - including hairstyles, dyes, and mix &amp; match outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 A modular housing system ready to be personalized on your own mountain peak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 Atmospheric and delightful seasonal soundtracks\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u27e2 Impeccable social vibes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br/> <br/><strong><i>Note: Game progress does not transfer between the Steam and mobile versions of Spirit Crossing.</i></strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Rebuild the connection between worlds in Spirit Crossing, a collaborative life-sim MMO from the makers of \"Cozy Grove.\" Explore distant mountaintop ruins, save lost spirits, befriend tiny bears, and build sanctuaries with other players while you carve out a cozy mountainside home of your own.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/5b8e9a96dfaddcbd4a352efac50982ba92368818/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1785252223", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "MMORPG", "Relaxing", "Cozy", "Building", "Crafting"], "developers": "Spry Fox", "publishers": "Spry Fox", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2321960", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "6 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/CIWsLe2LFzk", "first_seen": 1780704000.0, "review_rank": 459}